<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 58.11 to 6925.07.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.25 to 417.89.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.44.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1601 to 896.</p>
<p>Volume was 464,677,570 compared with 566,217,380 on Wednesday.</p>
